ns examples.parallel-reduction

;; A balanced arithmetic tree: every leaf multiplication is independent and
;; reduces in the SAME BSP round (wide parallel reduction); then each layer of
;; sums reduces in parallel. The shape of the mantra: all-at-once, in parallel.

[int+ [int+ [int+ [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 1 6] [int* 9 5]] [int+ [int* 3 5] [int* 5 2]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 6 5] [int* 5 3]] [int+ [int* 1 6] [int* 5 7]]]] [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 7 3] [int* 4 6]] [int+ [int* 6 4] [int* 4 4]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 1 9] [int* 2 3]] [int+ [int* 3 1] [int* 4 5]]]]] [int+ [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 7 5] [int* 7 9]] [int+ [int* 8 6] [int* 1 5]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 8 5] [int* 7 6]] [int+ [int* 2 1] [int* 6 5]]]] [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 8 8] [int* 3 3]] [int+ [int* 1 5] [int* 6 2]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 3 1] [int* 8 1]] [int+ [int* 4 1] [int* 5 2]]]]]] [int+ [int+ [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 1 8] [int* 3 2]] [int+ [int* 4 1] [int* 4 3]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 8 7] [int* 8 1]] [int+ [int* 1 2] [int* 4 4]]]] [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 9 1] [int* 8 3]] [int+ [int* 6 5] [int* 4 3]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 5 9] [int* 2 4]] [int+ [int* 8 1] [int* 7 7]]]]] [int+ [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 2 8] [int* 4 9]] [int+ [int* 9 6] [int* 8 8]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 4 9] [int* 7 3]] [int+ [int* 3 8] [int* 4 6]]]] [int+ [int+ [int+ [int* 7 9] [int* 9 6]] [int+ [int* 4 3] [int* 8 3]]] [int+ [int+ [int* 1 8] [int* 3 2]] [int+ [int* 6 8] [int* 5 2]]]]]]]
